# modules/pulse/env.schema — KEY=description:required|optional
SENTINEL_DATA_DIR=Host data root; supplies the read-only /certs wildcard mount:required
MESH_BIND_IP=Mesh interface IP the Kuma UI binds to (port 3001):required
TZ=Firm timezone; Kuma maintenance windows and status pages render in it:optional
UPTIME_KUMA_SSL_CERT=Pure-mesh TLS only — /certs/live/wildcard.crt. Leave unset while the tunnel status page uses an HTTP origin:optional
UPTIME_KUMA_SSL_KEY=Pure-mesh TLS only — /certs/live/wildcard.key. Set together with UPTIME_KUMA_SSL_CERT or not at all:optional
